{"articleNo":"104086","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=104086&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"한국문화관광연구원 관광지식정보시스템 블로그 대학생 기자단 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.03.20","hit":"2675","attachments":[{"name":"제2기 '누리누비'블로그 기자단 모집(양식포함).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=104086&attachNo=72141"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕130; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">관광지식정보시스템 블로그「관광지식털기」</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; FONT-SIZE: 23pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕130; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">제2기‘누리누비’블로그 기자단 모집</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조130\">문화체육관광부 산하 연구기관인 (재)한국문화관광연구원 정책정보통계센터 관광지식정보시스템(Tour.go.kr)에서 운영 중인 블로그 「관광지식털기」에서 제2기 블로그 기자단 ‘누리누비’를 모집합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조130\">온 세상을 누비며(누리누비) 관광통계 및 관광 관련 정보를 널리 알릴, 열정이 넘치는 여러분들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조130\"></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤명조130\"></span><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕330; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕330; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕330\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 지원자격</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕330; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕330; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕330\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 글쓰기에 능통하고, SNS활동을 적극적으로 하고 있는 대학(원)생 및 휴학생(관광/사진 관련 전공자 우대)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 사진 및 동영상 제작/편집 등 미디어 활용이 가능한 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤명조130; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤명조130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 능동적이며 열정적인 활동이 가능한 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕330; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕330; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕330; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕330; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕330; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕330; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 모집인원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"-\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 총 12명(6팀) </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"-\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 2인 1팀으로 구성</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"-\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕330; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕330; mso-hansi-font-family: -윤고딕330\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"-\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤명조130; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕330; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕330; mso-hansi-font-family: -